{
 "id": "armour_vanguard_set",
 "kind": "body-fitted-armour",
 "description": "Cinderlock Regalia, the Kinetic Vanguard armour set, as six game-ready modules (Reactor Cuirass, deltoid caps and bicep guards, Induction Gauntlets, tactical trousers with belt and thigh plates, Impact Greaves, Anchor Boots): segmented dark gunmetal hard-surface plates over a carbon-weave undersuit with crimson emissive channels, after the owner's concept sheet and production specification (2026-11-19, 2026-11-20). Fitted to both project bodies, skinned to the shared skeleton, built high-detail and baked onto budgeted low meshes (two shared 2K atlases, LOD0-2). Worn by players through the Vanguard class-set items (vanguard_field_set_*) and by the Severance Soldier patrols.",
